sequenceDiagram
  participant Operator
  participant API as Operator API
  participant Registry as Application Registry
  participant Graphile as Graphile Worker public utilities
  Operator->>API: action + reason + idempotency key + version
  API->>Registry: tenant-scoped claim
  Registry-->>API: delivery + pending audit action
  API->>Graphile: rescheduleJobs or completeJobs
  Graphile-->>API: public result
  API->>Registry: terminal action outcome + version increment
  API-->>Operator: sanitized result
